        "description": "Characteristic facial dysmorphism including a broad nasal bridge and prominent forehead",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all four major criteria: hair abnormalities, retinal dystrophy, dental anomalies, and digital malformations",
